# EcoSuit MK.I — Materials list
**Plates · exo · joints · sternum cup (ABH-2600-SM) · dorsal harness (FTL-BH-1 / DSH-1) · soft goods**
Paper article. Not a method to build a horizon or an FTL drive.

---

## 1. Thermal / armor faces (OML)

| ID | Material | Where | Why |
|---|---|---|---|
| CER-B | High-purity silica or alumina-silica ceramic, black borosilicate / glass coat (HRSI analog) | Ventral plates, leading edges, harness leading edges, sternum cap | High-heat, abrasion, optical |
| CER-W | Same substrate, white silica + alumina coat (LRSI analog) | Dorsal acreage, radiator petals, low-heat zones | On-orbit thermal control |
| CER-D | Densified IML slurry on ceramic inner face | Every bonded ceramic | Bond-line strength (Shuttle lesson) |
| CER-WP | Waterproof / AO overcoat | All ceramic OML after coat-fire | Moisture and atomic oxygen |
| CAP-S | Ceramic-faced composite sternum cap, faceted, removable | ABH-2600-SM forward cap | Matches plastron language; LRU |

Do not bolt through ceramic. Do not leave sharp ceramic edges. Chamfer or radius every free edge.

