## 6. Joints and actuators

| ID | Material / article | Where | Why |
|---|---|---|---|
| BRG | Space-rated rotary bearings (purchased LRU) | Shoulder, hip, waist, ankle as designed | Constant-volume motion |
| CONV | Fabric / elastomer rolling convolute | Elbow, knee, waist | Soft DOF |
| SEA-H | Rotary series-elastic actuator housing: Al or Ti + steel spring | Hip yoke, thigh longeron | Walk / kneel |
| CSEA | Bowden / tendon + distal spring; steel or qualified synthetic line | Shoulder, elbow, ankle | Motors stay on dorsal pack |
| CLU | Mechanical clutch / freewheel | Every powered joint | Fail-open |
| SPR | Passive springs (steel or composite) | Shoulder gravity-balance, suit-torque cancel | Layer 0 |
| DEA-SI | Space-adjacent silicone elastomer (Elastosil / PDMS class), not VHB acrylic | Interior glove / DEMES only | Soft goods in gas |
| DEA-CNT | Encapsulated CNT electrode, pre-cleared | DEA faces | Self-clear; no carbon grease |
| V-EBM | PI ~25 µm (or PTFE / Mylar / Parylene candidate) + metallization + thin anti-arc coat + 5 µm annular adhesive | Exterior plate latches, visor cap | Vacuum-gap zipper; inhibit in air |
| HV-PI | Polyimide / PEEK bosses, 8 mm creepage | HV runs | V-EBM 4–6 kV |

Forbidden as primary gait drive: open hydraulics, suit-O2 pneumatics, SMA on legs, V-EBM inside the bladder, DEA on the exterior.

