## 7. Sternum cup — ABH-2600-SM only

| ID | Material | Where | Why |
|---|---|---|---|
| CUP-CU | OFHC copper or TZM liner, 1.0–1.5 mm | Cup inner | Conduction |
| CUP-TI | Ti-6Al-4V wall, 4–6 mm | Primary cup | Structure (default) |
| CUP-IN | Inconel 718 wall, 4–6 mm | Alternate primary cup | Higher temp / bearing |
| CUP-SG | S-glass / PI wrap, 2 mm | Cup outer | Electrical isolation |
| CUP-W | W or W-Cu graded layer, 2–4 mm | Aft wall (crew side) only | Dose stand-off for SM analog |
| CUP-PEEK | PEEK / PI stand-off bosses | HV / sense if any | Creepage |
| CUP-QD | Stainless 4 mm coolant QDs | Cup jacket | Isolated from LCVG by HX |

Cup forbids: hemp, unsealed ceramic chips, carbon grease, open hydraulics, any tube labeled “to Rs.”

SM analog waste heat ≤ 150 W continuous / 400 W peak. 116 MW REAL-core flux is not this cup’s job.

