## 11. Explicit rejects

| Do not put on the article | Why |
|---|---|
| Acrylic VHB as DEA dielectric | Creep, vacuum, cold, outgas |
| Carbon grease electrodes | Vacuum / crew |
| Open hydraulic plant in the garment | Leak = contamination |
| Unclutched harmonic drive as sole joint path | Locked-joint fatality |
| Hemp inside the sternum cup | Wrong job; wick + char |
| Ceramic as bolt land | Brittle; isolate with SIP stack |
| ABH-2600-REAL mass (1.75e12 kg) in the worn mass properties | Gravity / tide FAIL-CLOSED at sternum |
| Any line that “terminates at Rs” | Horizon is 2.60 fm; ice cannot feed it |
| FTL mechanism as a listed material | Not available under known physics; harness is structure + services |

