## 12. Minimum coupon set (materials qualification)

1. CER + ADH-F + HEMP/MAT-P + BK-SG — flatwise tension, thermal cycle, outgas
2. Edge-sealed hemp core — vacuum bake + moisture regain
3. S1–S4 doubler on HUT coupon — 2 × Case A proof
4. Cup wall (CUP-TI or CUP-IN) + CUP-W aft — thermal + dose analog
5. V-EBM PI pair — TVAC + Paschen sweep + inhibit
6. DEA-SI + DEA-CNT — pre-clear + glove-finger TVAC
7. SEA housing + CLU — fail-open demonstration

Genealogy: every ceramic face, every hemp batch, every cup, every harness longeron gets a serial. Shuttle tile history is the warning.